## Create Order API

## Data Structures

### Order (object)

+ merchant_api_key: ABCD1234XXXX (string, required) - Your API key for authentication.
+ currency: EUR (string, required) - Currency code (e.g. EUR, USD).
+ item_details: (ItemDetails, required)
+ address_details (AddressDetails, required) - details about shipment and billing
+ order_reference: LL1123 (string, optional) - Your internal reference for the order.
+ purchase_order: Po1234 (string, optional) - Optional purchase order reference.
+ cost_centre: (string, optional) - A specific department, location, or function that is assigned responsibility for the print costs
+ billing_entity_id: (number, optional) - id of the billing entity

### AddressDetails (object)

+ email_address (string, required) - email of the customer. They will receive order confirmation and shipping details on this address
+ shipping_address (ShippingAddress, required) - shipping address
+ billing_address (ShippingAddress, optional) - billing address

### ShippingAddress (object)

+ first_name (string, required)
+ last_name (string, required)
+ address_line_1 (string, required) - street and number or POBox
+ address_line_2 (string, required) - building, apartment, other
+ zip_code (string, required)
+ city (string, required)
+ state (string)
+ country_code (string, required) - ISO Code 2, e.g "US", "NL"
+ phone_number (string, optional)
+ company_name (string, optional)
+ vat_number (string, optional)
+ vat_country_code (string, optional)

### ItemDetails (object)
+ title (string, optional)
+ item_reference (string, optional)
+ offering_id (number, required) - The product ID from your test account
+ quantity (number, required)
+ file_details (FileDetails, required)

### FileDetails (object)

+ content_url (string, required) - Source file to be printed. 
+ cover_url (string) - Cover file should contain in 1 image: back cover, spine and front cover. If cover is NOT sent as a separate file, it will be formed from the first and last pages of the content file and the spine
+ spine_details (SpineDetails) - You can provide an URL to the spine OR give us texts and fonts and we build it for you OR use only a color set in your account (default is white) 
+ content_width (number, required) - width of the content file
+ content_height (number, required) - height of the content file
+ number_of_pages (number, required) - Number of pages of cover and content

### SpineDetails (object)

+ custom_spine_url (string) - Spine URL. If you already have a spine generated for the file, use this.
+ dynamic_spine_details (DynamicSpineDetails) - Based on this object we generate the spine for you. Default spine is white with no text if no details provided. You can change the default colour in your account.

### DynamicSpineDetails (object)

+ text_font: Arial, Brandon, DarkCourier, Georgia, GochiHand, Helvetica, Tahoma, TimesNewRoman, Verdana (enum)
+ text_size (number) - Font size for the text
+ text_colour (string) - in of the hex format: #RRGGBB
+ background_colour (string) - in of the hex format: #RRGGBB
+ text_center (string) - Text in the center of the spine
+ text_bottom (string) - Text at the bottom of the spine
+ text_top (string) - Text at the top of the spine

### PaymentRequest (object)

+ order_id (number, required) - id of the order to be paid
+ merchant_api_key (string, required) - API key of your account
+ secret (string, required) - SHA-256 encoded value of the string formed by putting together your secret key and the order number e.g for secretKey="SECRETABCD" and orderId=1234, you have SHA-256("SECRETABCD1234") = "4bf65a3ffc022f0070babee6540048dfc1a3faad270f62f8084fe66f94ebf8fd"

### UpdateAddressRequest (object)

+ order_id (number, required) - id of the order to be paid
+ merchant_api_key (string, required) - API key of your account
+ address_details (AddressDetails, required) - If the order was already paid you can no longer change the country or the state!

### SetFilesRequest (object)

+ order_id (number, required) - id of the order missing files
+ merchant_api_key (string, required) - API key of your account
+ file_details (FileDetails, required) - URLs and configurations for the files to be printed

### StatusResponse (object)

+ order_id (number)
+ order_state (enum) - The order status listened on the section Peecho Orders of this documentation
+ moderation_reason (string) - If the order is in MODERATION state, this will state the reason
+ created_date (string)
+ currency (string)
+ merchant_order_reference
+ tracking_code (string) - after order is shipped
+ tracking_url (string) - after order is shipped
+ order_price_data (OrderPriceData)
+ item_price_data (ItemPriceData)
+ address_details (ReturnedAddressDetails)
+ fulfilment_location (FulfilmentLocation)

### OrderPriceData (object)

+ total_retail_product_price_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_retail_shipping_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_retail_price_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_retail_price_inc_taxes (string)
+ retail_product_taxes (RetailProductTaxes)
+ retail_shipping_taxes (RetailShippingTaxes)
+ total_wholesale_product_price_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_wholesale_shipping_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_wholesale_price_ex_taxes (string)
+ total_wholesale_price_inc_taxes (string)
+ wholesale_product_taxes (WholesaleProductTaxes)
+ wholesale_shipping_taxes (WholesaleShippingTaxes)

### RetailProductTaxes (object)

+ tax_name
+ tax_percentage
+ amount

### RetailShippingTaxes (object)

+ tax_name
+ tax_percentage
+ amount

### WholesaleProductTaxes (object)

+ tax_name
+ tax_percentage
+ amount

### WholesaleShippingTaxes

+ tax_name
+ tax_percentage
+ amount

### ItemPriceData (object)

+ item_id (string)
+ number_of_pages (number)
+ offering_id
+ publication_id - product listing id
+ quantity
+ retail_product_price
+ retail_product_taxes (RetailProductTaxes)
+ retail_shipping_price
+ retail_shipping_taxes (RetailShippingTaxes)
+ wholesale_product_price
+ wholesale_product_taxes (WholesaleProductTaxes)
+ wholesale_shipping_price 
+ wholesale_shipping_taxes (WholesaleShippingTaxes)
+ total_wholesale_price_ex_taxes
+ total_wholesale_price_inc_taxes

### ReturnedAddressDetails (object)

+ first_name
+ last_name
+ address_line_1
+ address_line_2
+ country_code (string, required)
+ zip_code (string, required)
+ city (string, required)
+ state (string)

### FulfilmentLocation (object)

+ country_code
+ lab_code

### PricingDto (object)

+ currency (string) - currency code for price presentation e.g "EUR" or "USD"
+ price (number) - base price
+ pricePerPage (number) - price for each extra page

### QuoteRequest (object)
+ apiKey (required, number) - API key of your account
+ countryCode (required, string) - ISO 2 code of the country where the product will be shipped
+ state (optional, string) - State where the order will be shipped. Optional
+ currency(optional, string) - Currency in which to show the prices. Default EUR
+ items (required, array[QuoteItemDto]) - Quoted product items

### QuoteItemDto (object)
+ offeringId (required, number) - Id of the offering in your account
+ numberOfPages(optional, number) - Number of pages of the content file. If not specified or too high/low the minimum/maximum for the product will be used for the quote
+ quantity(required, number) - Number of copies

### AvailableCountriesForOfferingsRequest (object)
+ merchantApiKey (string, required)
+ offeringsId (array[number])

### BillingEntityRequest (object)

+ api_key (string, required) - API key of your account
+ parentEntityId (number) - Parent billing entity id. If you leave this empty, you create a parent billing entity.
+ firstName (string, required)
+ lastName (string, required)
+ companyName (string, required)
+ addressLine1 (string, required) - Street and number or POBox
+ addressLine2 (string) - Building, apartment, other
+ zipCode (string, required)
+ state (string)
+ city (string)
+ countryCode (string, required) - ISO Code 2, e.g "US", "NL"
+ vatNumber (string)
+ chamberOfCommerce (string)
+ phoneNumber (string)
+ emailAddresses (array[string], required) - Array of at least one email address

### CreatePublication (object)

+ apiKey (string) - API key of your account
+ order (OrderDto) - The merchant reference number
+ customSpine (string) - Here you can provide an URL to the spine (OR use the following fields to give us texts and fonts and we build it for you)
+ spineColorHex (string) - 
+ spineText (string) - 
+ spineTextTop (string) -
+ spineTextBottom (string) -
+ spineTextSize (number) -
+ spineTextColor (string) -
+ spineFontFamily: Arial, Brandon, DarkCourier, Georgia, GochiHand, Helvetica, Tahoma, TimesNewRoman, Verdana (enum)
+ currency (string) -  currency code for price display e.g "EUR" or "USD"
+ locale: en, es, nl, de, fi, sv, it, fr, pl (enum)
+ filterSize
+ filterColour
+ filterCategory
+ fixedOfferingId
+ fixedOfferingPrice
+ redirect (RedirectDto) -
+ enableSecureCheckout (boolean) - Send a 'true' value if you want to enable the secure checkout enabling only authorised users to access it. This will make the endpoint return a secure_publication_id and a token. Access the checkout using this endpoint: https://test.www.peecho.com/checkout/print/en/{secure_publication_id}?token={token}.
+ secureCheckoutExpirationDate (string) - Send an expiration date in the CET timezone if you want the secure checkout to expire after a while, in this format 'dd-MM-yyyy HH:mm:ss'.

### OrderDto (object)
+ reference (string) - If this is completed, any order for this product listing (publication) will have this as a reference so you can recognize the order in your internal system
+ product (ProductDto)

### ProductDto (object)
+ title (string) - Title of this product listing (publication)
+ source (SourceDto) - The file of the 
+ thumbnail (ThumbnailDto) - thumbnail details that will appear in checkout

### SourceDto (object)
+ file (FileDto)

### FileDto (object)
+ src (string) - source file location
+ coverSrc (string) - cover file location
+ pages (number) - number of pages
+ dimensions (DimensionsDto) - dimensions details

### DimensionsDto (object)
+ width (number)
+ height (number)

### ThumbnailDto (object)
+ src (string) - source file location
+ width (number)
+ height (number)

### RedirectDto (object)
+ cancellation (RedirectCancellationDto)
+ error (RedirectErrorDto)
+ thankyou (RedirectThankYouDto) 

### RedirectCancellationDto (object)
+ href (string) - URL to the custom message/page to show when the checkout session is canceled.

### RedirectErrorDto (object)
+ href (string) - URL to the custom message/page when there is an checkout error

### RedirectThankYouDto (object)
+ href (string) - URL to the custom message/page when the purchase is successful.

## Create a new order [POST /order]
The Order object contains all of the data needed to create and manage an order. Most fields remain static after creation, while dynamic fields such as status and shipments update as the order progresses through its lifecycle.</a>


<ul>
  <li><strong>Create order with files</strong> – You can create an order that already includes the file(s) by specifying the file URL in the file_details parameter. The order will immediately proceed to file processing once payment is submitted.
</li>
  <li><strong>Create order without files</strong> – You can create an order without attaching the files upfront and send them later asynchronously. This method uses the same parameters as creating an order with files, but you leave the file_details field empty.
</li>
<ul>

+ Attributes (Order)
    
+ Request (application/json)
{
    "merchant_api_key": "API_KEY",
    "purchase_order" : "",
    "currency": "EUR",
    "item_details": [
        {
            "item_reference" : "hardcover_22",
            "offering_id": 233309,
            "quantity": 3,
            "file_details": {
                "content_url": "https://calin-thumbnailer.s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/wall-tiles-test.pdf",
                "content_width": 210,
                "content_height": 29.7,
                "number_of_pages": 80,
                "spine_details":{
                    "dynamic_spine_details": {
                        "text_font":"Arial",
                        "text_size":10,
                        "text_colour":"#77493f",
                        "text_top":"top text",
                        "text_center":"center text",
                        "text_bottom":"bottom text"
                    }
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "item_reference" : "hardcover_23",
            "offering_id": 233309,
            "quantity": 2,
            "file_details": {
