# Check products/offerings [/products]

## List products and offerings [GET /offering/list]
In the Peecho dashboard under Settings, you can find all of the products that Peecho offers. All products set as active in your account can be queried using the offering API.
The ID that you find under the product name is the offering ID. The endpoint returns the product catalog ID and its attributes.

+ Parameters
    + merchantApiKey (required, Number, `ABCD1234XXXX`)
    + countryIsoCode2 (optional, String, 'NL')...Only return offerings that are available in this country
    + subCategoryFilter (optional, enum) - Filter offerings by subCategory. Use subCategory code (GET /rest/v3/categories to get subCategory codes)
    + categoryFilter (optional, enum) - Filter offerings by category. Use category code (GET /rest/v3/categories to get category codes) 
    + currency(optional, String, `USD`)...Currency in which to show the prices. The default is EUR
    
+ Request (application/json)

+ Response 200 (application/json)


+ Body

{
