## Quote [POST /quote]
The Quote endpoint lets you retrieve pricing and shipping information for a set of products without creating an order. You can also use it to check whether the selected products can be fulfilled together as a multi-item order. The offeringId used in the request corresponds to the productId shown in your account under Settings > Products.


