## Get spine width before creating order [GET /offering/spine]
Calculate the required spine width for a product or offering before placing an order.


+ Request (application/json)

+ Parameters
    + merchantApiKey (required, String, `ABCD1234XXXX`)
    + offeringId (required, Number, `179270`)...Id of the offering in your account
    + countryCodeIso2 (required, String, `US`)...ISO 2 code of the country where the product will be shipped
    + state (optional, String, `NY`)...State where the order will be shipped. Optional
    + numberOfPages (required, Number, `45`)...

+ Response 200 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {"spineWidth":23.0}
         
+ Response 404 (application/json)

    + Body
    
            {"url": "http://localhost:8080/rest/v3/offering/spine","details": "No suitable shipping option for country: USA and state: NY!","timestamp": "2020-10-19T17:12:57.091","custom_code": "NO_PF"}          

