# Product listing-publication [/product-listing]

## Create a product listing-publication [POST /publication/create]
Create a product listing that users can order via the Peecho Checkout. After creation, you can use the ID returned by the endpoint and go to https://test.www.peecho.com/print/{ID} to view the checkout page for that product or publication.  

The product listing can be set up as a single product with a specific price, or as multiple products from the same category with prices determined by the profit markup defined in your account settings.

+ Request (application/json)

+ Attributes (CreatePublication)

        {"apiKey":"APABCD1234XXXXI","currency":"EUR","locale":"nl","order":{"reference":"DK123LLP","product":{"title":"Test Publication endpoint","source":{"file":{"src":"https://calin-thumbnailer.s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/api-test.pdf","pages":28,"dimensions":{"height":210,"width":297}}},"thumbnail":{"src":"https://calin-thumbnailer.s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/download.jfif"}}}}

